OL,3,GNEWSACrime-hit city centre alley to be
OL,4,Agated off
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to gate off a notorious city
OL,7,Fcentre alleyway that has become a
OL,8,Fhotspot for crime and anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour have been approved.
OL,11,FPolice call-outs to the 11m (36ft)
OL,12,Falleyway, which links Ivegate and
OL,13,FTyrell Street in Bradford, have become
OL,14,F"unsustainable", according to a council
OL,15,Freport.
OL,17,FIn one of the latest incidents last
OL,18,Fweek, West Yorkshire Police said an
OL,19,F18-year-old man had been stabbed in the
OL,20,Falley.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
