OL,3,GNEWSACrime-hit city centre alley to be
OL,4,Agated off
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, because the alley is still a
OL,7,Fpublic right of way, the council must
OL,8,Fgo through a legal process to formally
OL,9,Fclose the route before gates can be
OL,10,Finstalled.
